          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "Every member can turn on two-factor authentication under Profile, then Security, with an authenticator app or a security key. Owners and Admins can require two-factor authentication for the whole workspace; members without it are asked to set it up at their next sign-in."
        },
